    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d465">

                <pb facs="1163" n="1049" xml:id="pg1049"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source"> J.C.S. Files</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Note by the Secretaries of the Combined Chiefs of
                        Staff</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/> C.C.S. 317/2</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Quebec</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-08-22">22 August 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Equipping Allies, Liberated Forces and Friendly
                        Neutrals</hi>
                </p>
                <p>Action on C.C.S. 317<anchor n="1" xml:id="d465-f1"/> has been deferred pending
                    further study of the subject by the British Chiefs of Staff.</p>
                <p>The United States Chiefs of Staff, however, recommend that immediate decision be
                    rendered on the recommendations contained in paragraph 10 <hi
                        rendition="#italic">a</hi> and <hi rendition="#italic">b</hi> of that paper.
                    These paragraphs pertain to the equipment of French forces in North Africa. A
                    decision at this time is necessary because of certain administrative
                    arrangements which should be carried out at once in the event that the
                    recommendations are to be approved.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed> H. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Redman</hi>
                        <lb/> J. K. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Deane</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Combined Secretariat</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
